            </style></head><body><div xmlns="" class="page-wrapper"><h2 class="auth__title">Акт инвентаризации расчетов с покупателями, поставщиками и прочими дебиторами и кредиторами</h2><div class="doc-snippet">
  Когда понадобится: при составлении акта инвентаризации расчетов с&nbsp;покупателями, поставщиками и&nbsp;прочими дебиторами и&nbsp;кредиторами при проведении <span num="5" lnktype="intlnk" title="" class="doc">инвентаризации</span> 
</div><div class="page-box" id="doc-box"><div class="doc-page"><div id="documentConftent" class="content content-form"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr1/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasmenxgn/" data-dfa="dfasmenxgn"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/backlinkanchor7/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/14820/dfasea0yrd/" class="npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="14820" anchor="dfasea0yrd"><strong>Приложение №&nbsp;16</strong></a><br><strong>к&nbsp;НСБУ №&nbsp;19</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr2/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas7gnxkt/" data-dfa="dfas7gnxkt"></a><strong>АКТ</strong><br><strong>инвентаризации расчетов с&nbsp;покупателями,</strong><br><strong>поставщиками и&nbsp;прочими дебиторами и&nbsp;кредиторами</strong><br><strong>№ </strong><span class="fill">1</span><span id="sfwc_1" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasmq2tx3/" data-dfa="dfasmq2tx3"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr3/"></a>Укажите порядковый номер документа</span></span></p><div align="center"><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdRight" colspan="7" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr4/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas1up4t5/" data-dfa="dfas1up4t5"></a>ИНН</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr5/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasx7v2q1/" data-dfa="dfasx7v2q1"></a>111111111</span><span id="sfwc_2" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasguevwk/" data-dfa="dfasguevwk"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr6/"></a>Укажите ИНН организации</span></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasigiysm/" data-dfa="dfasigiysm"></a></td><td class="bdRight" style="vertical-align: top; width: 24.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasakd6fp/" data-dfa="dfasakd6fp"></a></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasg6mpyv/" data-dfa="dfasg6mpyv"></a>Код</td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasa7wgx7/" data-dfa="dfasa7wgx7"></a></td><td style="vertical-align: top; width: 14.18%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas1kxyzk/" data-dfa="dfas1kxyzk"></a></td><td class="bdRight" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top; width: 24.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr8/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas31yspp/" data-dfa="dfas31yspp"></a>Форма N&nbsp;инв-17 по<br>ОКУД</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasao2k32/" data-dfa="dfasao2k32"></a></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: top; width: 32.42%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr9/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasu9snpw/" data-dfa="dfasu9snpw"></a>Организация</td><td class="bdBottom" colspan="5" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasn1ozgq/" data-dfa="dfasn1ozgq"></a>ООО «Альфа»</span><span id="sfwc_3" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas90e64v/" data-dfa="dfas90e64v"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr11/"></a>Укажите наименование организации</span></span></td><td class="bdRight" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top; width: 24.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr12/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfase4dhdk/" data-dfa="dfase4dhdk"></a>Дата (год, число, месяц)</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr13/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasyf2nu9/" data-dfa="dfasyf2nu9"></a>31.12.2024</span><span id="sfwc_4" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasa9qiah/" data-dfa="dfasa9qiah"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr14/"></a>Здесь укажите дату составления акта</span></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr15/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas8r0q21/" data-dfa="dfas8r0q21"></a>Структурная единица организации</td><td class="bdBottom" colspan="3" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasowuryv/" data-dfa="dfasowuryv"></a></td><td class="bdRight" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top; width: 24.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasavzgav/" data-dfa="dfasavzgav"></a>по&nbsp;ОКПО</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfastgl1t1/" data-dfa="dfastgl1t1"></a></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfaslbk0y6/" data-dfa="dfaslbk0y6"></a>Основание для проведения инвентаризации: приказ,<br>постановление, распоряжение</td><td class="bdRight" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top; width: 24.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasr6hhfy/" data-dfa="dfasr6hhfy"></a>по&nbsp;ОКЭД</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas0op5ac/" data-dfa="dfas0op5ac"></a>11111</span><span id="sfwc_5" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas3g9odm/" data-dfa="dfas3g9odm"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr20/"></a>Укажите код ОКЭД присвоенный органами статистики</span></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasf8nsg9/" data-dfa="dfasf8nsg9"></a><sup>(ненужное зачеркнуть)</sup></td><td class="bdRight" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top; width: 24.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasi2v76p/" data-dfa="dfasi2v76p"></a></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasqsute5/" data-dfa="dfasqsute5"></a></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasmke24d/" data-dfa="dfasmke24d"></a></td><td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfaswdbc5z/" data-dfa="dfaswdbc5z"></a></td><td class="bdRight" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top; width: 24.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas5bcwlo/" data-dfa="dfas5bcwlo"></a>по&nbsp;ОКПО</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfash3z6fg/" data-dfa="dfash3z6fg"></a></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasid10w6/" data-dfa="dfasid10w6"></a></td><td colspan="4" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfaskh3gfb/" data-dfa="dfaskh3gfb"></a></td><td class="bdRight" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top; width: 24.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasl4g7ch/" data-dfa="dfasl4g7ch"></a>Дата начала<br>инвентаризации</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasuft8o1/" data-dfa="dfasuft8o1"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr24/"></a>20.12.2024<span id="sfwc_6" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasitpupp/" data-dfa="dfasitpupp"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr25/"></a>Укажите дату начала инвентаризации</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas0fwyvo/" data-dfa="dfas0fwyvo"></a></td><td colspan="4" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfaskunxx5/" data-dfa="dfaskunxx5"></a></td><td class="bdRight" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top; width: 24.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasb2mpnx/" data-dfa="dfasb2mpnx"></a>Дата окончания<br>инвентаризации</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfaswrbfr2/" data-dfa="dfaswrbfr2"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr27/"></a>28.12.2024&nbsp;<span id="sfwc_7" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas0gdz1z/" data-dfa="dfas0gdz1z"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr28/"></a>Укажите дату окончания инвентаризации</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasmfru36/" data-dfa="dfasmfru36"></a></td><td colspan="4" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas3kgxzi/" data-dfa="dfas3kgxzi"></a></td><td class="bdRight" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top; width: 24.21%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr29/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas75ys54/" data-dfa="dfas75ys54"></a>Дата проведения<br>инвентаризации</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasnpy2ic/" data-dfa="dfasnpy2ic"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr30/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfaszqxksp/" data-dfa="dfaszqxksp"></a>Единица измерения: <span class="fill">сум.</span></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr31/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas6f8l3i/" data-dfa="dfas6f8l3i"></a><strong>1. По&nbsp;дебиторской задолженности</strong></p><div align="center"><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3" style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><nobr><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr32/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfase921ga/" data-dfa="dfase921ga"></a>Наименование</nobr><br>счета<br>бухгалтерского<br>учета и&nbsp;дебитора</td><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3" style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><nobr><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr33/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasxltx8o/" data-dfa="dfasxltx8o"></a>Номер</nobr><br>счета</td><td class="bdAll" colspan="4" style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr34/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasbfkmen/" data-dfa="dfasbfkmen"></a>Сумма по&nbsp;балансу</td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><nobr><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr35/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasg3xmmn/" data-dfa="dfasg3xmmn"></a>всего</nobr></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="3" style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr36/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasbi1lby/" data-dfa="dfasbi1lby"></a>в&nbsp;том числе задолженность</td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><nobr><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr37/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfaspd4gpb/" data-dfa="dfaspd4gpb"></a>Подтвержденная</nobr><br>дебиторская</td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align: top; width: 22.63%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr38/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasnx1pqu/" data-dfa="dfasnx1pqu"></a>не-<br><nobr>подтвержденная</nobr><br>дебиторская</td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr39/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas037g1n/" data-dfa="dfas037g1n"></a>с <nobr>истекшим</nobr><br>сроком исковой<br>давности</td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr40/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas36oczk/" data-dfa="dfas36oczk"></a>1</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr41/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasb0wnvb/" data-dfa="dfasb0wnvb"></a>2</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr42/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas2r8sny/" data-dfa="dfas2r8sny"></a>3</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr43/"></a><a 