 data-dfa="dfasgeqog9"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr49/"></a>Укажите номер счета<br>, на&nbsp;котором отражена дебиторская задолженность. План счетов указан в <a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/backlinkanchor1/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/4023" data-warm-notices="45862861" data-warm-notice-type="error" class="npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="4023">НСБУ №&nbsp;21</a></span></span></span></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasp0de5i/" data-dfa="dfasp0de5i"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr50/"></a>300&nbsp;000<span id="sfwc_10" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasn9e4v5/" data-dfa="dfasn9e4v5"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr51/"></a>Укажите сумму дебиторской задолженности</span></span></span></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfaszhyhue/" data-dfa="dfaszhyhue"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr52/"></a>300&nbsp;000<span id="sfwc_11" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasx44ygi/" data-dfa="dfasx44ygi"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr53/"></a>Укажите сумму<br>подтвержденной дебиторской задолженности</span></span></span></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 22.63%;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas0bx0sa/" data-dfa="dfas0bx0sa"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr54/"></a>-<span id="sfwc_12" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasnd8875/" data-dfa="dfasnd8875"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr55/"></a>Укажите сумму<br>неподтвержденной дебиторской задолженности</span></span></span></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas6zq5h7/" data-dfa="dfas6zq5h7"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr56/"></a>300&nbsp;000<span id="sfwc_13" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas1sg307/" data-dfa="dfas1sg307"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr57/"></a>Укажите сумму<br>просроченной дебиторской задолженности</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTopbdRight" colspan="2" style="text-align: right; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr58/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasg48ngy/" data-dfa="dfasg48ngy"></a>Итого:</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><nobr><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr59/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas9e4m12/" data-dfa="dfas9e4m12"></a>300&nbsp;000</span></nobr></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr60/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasmqvrqg/" data-dfa="dfasmqvrqg"></a>300&nbsp;000</span></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 22.63%;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasyzatv4/" data-dfa="dfasyzatv4"></a></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top; width: 14.86%;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr61/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasdms2vz/" data-dfa="dfasdms2vz"></a>300&nbsp;000</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr62/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas03a0iw/" data-dfa="dfas03a0iw"></a><strong>1. По&nbsp;кредиторской задолженности</strong></p><div align="center"><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr63/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasd5a3up/" data-dfa="dfasd5a3up"></a>Наименование<br>счета<br>бухгалтерского<br>учета и&nbsp;кредитора</td><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr64/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfaskkdi79/" data-dfa="dfaskkdi79"></a>Номер<br>счета</td><td class="bdAll" colspan="7" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr65/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasmoux4k/" data-dfa="dfasmoux4k"></a>Сумма по&nbsp;балансу</td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr66/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasialvrq/" data-dfa="dfasialvrq"></a>всего</td><td class="bdAll" colspan="6" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr67/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasc27qhf/" data-dfa="dfasc27qhf"></a>в&nbsp;том числе задолженность</td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas78tg0h/" data-dfa="dfas78tg0h"></a></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="2" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr68/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas8c1b4t/" data-dfa="dfas8c1b4t"></a>Подтвержденная<br>кредиторская</td><td class="bdAll" colspan="3" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr69/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasygdr6v/" data-dfa="dfasygdr6v"></a>не-<br>подтвержденная<br>кредиторская</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr70/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas238hxg/" data-dfa="dfas238hxg"></a>с&nbsp;истекшим<br>сроком<br>исковой<br>давности</td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr71/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasdnhgwa/" data-dfa="dfasdnhgwa"></a>1</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr72/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasbh4ipz/" data-dfa="dfasbh4ipz"></a>2</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr73/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasm9lm39/" data-dfa="dfasm9lm39"></a>3</td><td class="bdAll" colspan="2" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr74/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas4gs7qh/" data-dfa="dfas4gs7qh"></a>4</td><td class="bdAll" colspan="3" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr75/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasqwgllc/" data-dfa="dfasqwgllc"></a>5</td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center; vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/bssPhr76/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfaswzn2nm/" data-dfa="dfaswzn2nm"></a>6</td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfas735u93/" data-dfa="dfas735u93"></a></td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasximy1e/" data-dfa="dfasximy1e"></a></td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201596/dfasgcvqgt/" data-dfa="dfasgcvqgt"></a></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="2" style=